          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Fungal Possession"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(concentrate, manipulate, move, possession)\n\nRequirements: The cythnophorian's last action was a Strike that killed a target of size Medium or smaller\n\nThe cythnophorian rips itself out of its current host and burrows its way into the corpse of its latest victim, regaining 3d4 Hit Points and taking control of the corpse as its new host. The cythnophorian enters the space of its new host, and its former host's corpse falls to the ground in its previous space. Moving to a new host doesn't change the cythnophorian's abilities or movement Speeds."
            },
